  "details": "Issue Description:\n\nWhen logging into multiple accounts on the same client, the new login screen repeatedly prompts for a verification (2FA) code every time I switch accounts. Before the recent login interface update, sessions were remembered for a long time without needing to re-enter the code.\n\n​Expected Behavior / Feature Request:\n\nPlease consider adding a quick-switch feature for saved accounts directly on the login screen, or revert to the previous behavior where returning to a previously authenticated account on the same device does not frequently require a new verification code.",
